    <briefdescription>
<para>A node of symbolizer markup. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If only the Text field is set, this represents a region of text outside a markup element. ANSI SGR control codes are also reported this way; if detected, then the control code will be the entirety of the Text field, and any surrounding text will be reported as preceding and following nodes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
